count":120,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":14},"text":"1/4\n\nThe WSJ surveyed 71 economists (repost) and this graphic is their outlook on inflation (cyan dots).\n—-\nThis has been the constant economic forecast for 5-plus years, in 18 to 24 months inflation will be back to 2%.\n\nAnd for 5-plus years it has been constantly wrong.\n\n🧵 https://t.co/5FS5y3pK9m https://t.co/KP97jwq4Ft","url":"https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2112923531063472554"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112922381970710528"]},"author_id":"3039504459","created_at":"2026-10-21T15:02:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112922385129025800"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"A device that stores a single positron and controls its quantum states could measure its magnetic moment with unprecedented precision, testing a symmetry principle central to quantum field theory.","display_url":"go.aps.org/4i9C8Hs","end":276,"expanded_url":"https://go.aps.org/4i9C8Hs","images":[{"height":200,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112922388333498368/Wz1cll0m?format=png&name=orig","width":200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112922388333498368/Wz1cll0m?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":253,"status":200,"title":"One-Positron Quantum Cyclotron","unwound_url":"https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/gbkc-6nlj","url":"https://t.co/bzlPvgZUrx"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/DXfmexveij","end":300,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2112922385129025800/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112922381970710528","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/DXfmexveij"}]},"id":"2112922385129025800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":1350,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":9},"text":"Researchers trapped a single positron in a Penning trap and resolved its quantum states, realizing a one-positron quantum cyclotron that could enable more precise measurements of positron and electron magnetic moments to test CPT symmetry.\n\nLearn